---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import MapView from "../components/MapView.astro";
---
<Base title="map | ghost-watts" pathname="/map">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl mb-2">How much rooftop solar grew, by city</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-700 max-w-prose">
      We compare each Meralco-franchise city's roofs in 2026 to the same roofs in 2022 using free satellite data. <strong>Stronger blue = more signal that rooftop solar grew there.</strong> Click any city for the underlying numbers and what they mean. The score is suggestive, not proof, at city-level resolution. <a href="/methodology" class="no-underline text-accent-steel">Full methodology</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <MapView />

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 text-xs text-ink-500">
    Aggregate framing only. No address-level claims. No PII. Cite as: ghost-watts (YYYY-QN), https://github.com/xmpuspus/ghost-watts. CC-BY-4.0 on data.
  </section>
</Base>
